"y":464,"width":55,"height":27}]},{"text":"시간은 각각의 CPU 버스트(burst)와 같다고 가정한다. 즉, 프로세스가 CPU를 자지한","words":[{"text":"시간은","x":307,"y":678,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"각각의","x":427,"y":679,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"CPU","x":545,"y":683,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"버스트(burst)와","x":642,"y":678,"width":252,"height":43},{"text":"같다고","x":907,"y":678,"width":103,"height":41},{"text":"가정한다.","x":1025,"y":681,"width":145,"height":40},{"text":"즉,","x":1187,"y":684,"width":44,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1248,"y":680,"width":179,"height":40},{"text":"CPU를","x":1441,"y":681,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"자지한","x":1582,"y":681,"width":102,"height":44}]},{"text":"시간은 각각의 CPU 버스트 시간과 같다.","words":[{"text":"시간은","x":307,"y":743,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"각각의","x":425,"y":744,"width":101,"height":41},{"text":"CPU","x":541,"y":749,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"버스트","x":637,"y":744,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"시간과","x":749,"y":743,"width":102,"height":41},{"text":"같다.","x":863,"y":743,"width":74,"height":41}]},{"text":"예를 들어 보자. 두 개의 프로세스 터, P2가 있다고 할 때, 터의 주기는 50, P2의 주","words":[{"text":"예를","x":373,"y":809,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"들어","x":456,"y":810,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"보자.","x":539,"y":810,"width":75,"height":40},{"text":"두","x":630,"y":812,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"개의","x":678,"y":809,"width":63,"height":41},{"text":"프로세스","x":757,"y":809,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"터,","x":905,"y":813,"width":47,"height":40},{"text":"P2가","x":967,"y":811,"width":75,"height":43},{"text":"있다고","x":1057,"y":812,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"할","x":1173,"y":814,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"때,","x":1223,"y":813,"width":42,"height":40},{"text":"터의","x":1280,"y":812,"width":72,"height":43},{"text":"주기는","x":1371,"y":811,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"50,","x":1494,"y":814,"width":53,"height":36},{"text":"P2의","x":1562,"y":812,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"주","x":1650,"y":817,"width":32,"height":37}]},{"text":"기는 100이라고 하자. 즉 = 50, P2 = 100이다. PI의 수행 시간 = 20, P2의 수행 시","words":[{"text":"기는","x":307,"y":874,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"100이라고","x":390,"y":875,"width":165,"height":40},{"text":"하자.","x":568,"y":876,"width":74,"height":40},{"text":"즉","x":658,"y":878,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"=","x":749,"y":893,"width":22,"height":12},{"text":"50,","x":781,"y":879,"width":48,"height":36},{"text":"P2","x":842,"y":888,"width":34,"height":32},{"text":"=","x":889,"y":892,"width":21,"height":13},{"text":"100이다.","x":923,"y":877,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"PI의","x":1074,"y":879,"width":70,"height":41},{"text":"수행","x":1161,"y":879,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"시간","x":1247,"y":878,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"=","x":1372,"y":894,"width":22,"height":12},{"text":"20,","x":1406,"y":881,"width":52,"height":35},{"text":"P2의","x":1474,"y":875,"width":74,"height":43},{"text":"수행","x":1566,"y":876,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"시","x":1651,"y":881,"width":27,"height":39}]},{"text":"간 t2 = 35이다. 각 프로세스의 마감시간은 다음 주기가 시작하기 전까지이다.","words":[{"text":"간","x":306,"y":940,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"t2","x":354,"y":946,"width":26,"height":37},{"text":"=","x":390,"y":957,"width":23,"height":13},{"text":"35이다.","x":423,"y":941,"width":117,"height":40},{"text":"각","x":556,"y":941,"width":35,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스의","x":601,"y":941,"width":165,"height":40},{"text":"마감시간은","x":782,"y":940,"width":171,"height":41},{"text":"다음","x":965,"y":942,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"주기가","x":1045,"y":943,"width":106,"height":40},{"text":"시작하기","x":1163,"y":943,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"전까지이다.","x":1318,"y":941,"width":189,"height":40}]},{"text":"먼저 두 프로세스가 모두 마감시간을 충족시기도록 스게줄링 가능한지 생각해 보아","words":[{"text":"먼저","x":373,"y":1006,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"두","x":454,"y":1009,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스가","x":504,"y":1008,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"모두","x":686,"y":1009,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"마감시간을","x":767,"y":1006,"width":171,"height":40},{"text"