기고도 여유시간이","words":[{"text":"이용률은","x":306,"y":1203,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"75%가","x":458,"y":1202,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"된다.","x":580,"y":1202,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"따라서","x":672,"y":1202,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"두","x":789,"y":1205,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스","x":838,"y":1203,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"모두","x":992,"y":1206,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"마감시간을","x":1077,"y":1204,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"충족시기고도","x":1269,"y":1204,"width":219,"height":39},{"text":"여유시간이","x":1508,"y":1202,"width":169,"height":42}]},{"text":"수 있을 것으로 보인다.","words":[{"text":"수","x":301,"y":1268,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"있을","x":351,"y":1267,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"것으로","x":432,"y":1267,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"보인다.","x":544,"y":1267,"width":110,"height":40}]},{"text":"P2의 우선순위가 터보다 높다고 가정하자. 두 프로세스의 수행 모습이 그림 5.21에","words":[{"text":"P2의","x":364,"y":1332,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"우선순위가","x":452,"y":1332,"width":173,"height":40},{"text":"터보다","x":637,"y":1334,"width":107,"height":42},{"text":"높다고","x":757,"y":1334,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"가정하자.","x":874,"y":1334,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"두","x":1034,"y":1336,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스의","x":1084,"y":1335,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"수행","x":1275,"y":1336,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"모습이","x":1363,"y":1335,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"그림","x":1489,"y":1333,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"5.21에","x":1577,"y":1335,"width":101,"height":40}]},{"text":"표현되어 있다. 그림에서 보듯이, P2가 먼저 수행을 시작해 시간 35에 수행을 끝낸다. 이","words":[{"text":"표현되어","x":300,"y":1396,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"있다.","x":455,"y":1397,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"그림에서","x":543,"y":1399,"width":132,"height":40},{"text":"보듯이,","x":691,"y":1400,"width":111,"height":39},{"text":"P2가","x":814,"y":1400,"width":74,"height":41},{"text":"먼저","x":902,"y":1399,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"수행을","x":980,"y":1399,"width":106,"height":39},{"te