39},{"text":"때문에","x":1579,"y":1593,"width":99,"height":42}]},{"text":"PI의 우선순위가 P2의 우선순위보다 높다. 이 스케줄링 정책을 적용했을 때, 두 프로세","words":[{"text":"PI의","x":299,"y":1658,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"우선순위가","x":388,"y":1658,"width":172,"height":40},{"text":"P2의","x":573,"y":1660,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"우선순위보다","x":658,"y":1660,"width":205,"height":39},{"text":"높다.","x":876,"y":1660,"width":76,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":972,"y":1659,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"스케줄링","x":1019,"y":1660,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"정책을","x":1178,"y":1661,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"적용했을","x":1300,"y":1661,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"때,","x":1462,"y":1660,"width":45,"height":39},{"text":"두","x":1525,"y":1661,"width":37,"height":36},{"text":"프로세","x":1577,"y":1661,"width":100,"height":38}]},{"text":"스의 수행 모습이 그림 5.22에 표현되어 있다. PI이 먼저 수행을 시작하여 시간 20에 수","words":[{"text":"스의","x":300,"y":1722,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"수행","x":382,"y":1723,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"모습이","x":464,"y":1724,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"그림","x":578,"y":1725,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"5.22에","x":657,"y":1725,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"표현되어","x":773,"y":1724,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":925,"y":1724,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"PI이","x":1013,"y":1724,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"먼저","x":1104,"y":1725,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"수행을","x":1185,"y":1726,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"시작하여","x":1309,"y":1726,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"시간","x":1469,"y":1724,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"20에","x":1557,"y":1724,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1648,"y":1725,"width":33,"height":39}]},{"text":"행을 끝낸다. 따라서 첫 번째 마감시간을 만족시킨다. 바로 P2가 수행을 시작해서 시간","words":[{"text":"행을","x":301,"y":1786,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"끝낸다.","x":384,"y":1788,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"따라서","x":511,"y":1789,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"첫","x":628,"y":1790,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"번째","x":677,"y":1789,"width":62,"height":38},